OL,5,G1600 Hitler: Countdown to War
OL,6,     FBy September 1938, Hitler had
OL,7,     Foccupied Austria and was intent on
OL,8,     Finvading Czechoslovakia. But the
OL,9,     FBritish and the French had made it
OL,10,     Fclear that they would go to war if
OL,11,     Fhe did so.
OL,12,G1700 The Men and the Machines That Beat
OL,13,G     Hitler
OL,14,     FMark Urban tells the incredible
OL,15,     Fstory of six heroic veterans who
OL,16,     Fserved in the Royal Tank Regiment
OL,17,     Fin WWII, starting with their time
OL,18,     Fin Dunkirk and North Africa.
