OL,9,     FGloucestershire, where experts
OL,10,     Fexamine a picture of Chairman Mao
OL,11,     Fby Andy Warhol and a rare
OL,12,     F18th-century dress.
OL,13,G1900 Ireland with Simon Reeve
OL,14,     FSimon begins his journey in the
OL,15,     Fsouth of Ireland by paramotoring
OL,16,     Fwith an Irish explorer before
OL,17,     Fdoing a spot of surfing and
OL,18,     Fclimbing Croagh Patrick in honour
OL,19,     Fof Ireland's patron saint.
